  <data name="{0} is {1:0}% below your recent average this session. It is the scenario holding the session back, so give it a **few extra warm-up runs**." xml:space="preserve"><value>本次训练中，{0} 比你最近的平均水平低 {1:0}%。它拖了整场训练的后腿，建议**多热身几局**。</value></data>
  <data name="{0} is {1:0}% above your recent average this session. You are in rhythm on it, so this is a good time to **push for a personal best**." xml:space="preserve"><value>本次训练中，{0} 比你最近的平均水平高 {1:0}%。你在这个场景里正有节奏，现在是**冲击个人最佳**的好时机。</value></data>
  <data name="The second half of your session scored {0:0}% lower than the first. Focus tends to fade after a while, so try a **short break** halfway or end the session sooner." xml:space="preserve"><value>本次训练后半段的分数比前半段低 {0:0}%。注意力往往会随时间下降，可以在中途**短暂休息**，或者提前结束训练。</value></data>
  <data name="The first half of your session scored {0:0}% lower than the second. You seem to need time to settle in, so **warm up** on an easier scenario before the ones that count." xml:space="preserve"><value>本次训练前半段的分数比后半段低 {0:0}%。你似乎需要一些时间进入状态，建议在重要场景之前先用较简单的场景**热身**。</value></data>
  <data name="You fired {0:0.00} shots per kill at targets already dead this session, against {1:0.00} recently. Tiredness or impatience often causes this, so **release the click** the moment a target breaks." xml:space="preserve"><value>本次训练中，你每次击杀会向已被击杀的目标多开 {0:0.00} 枪，最近平均为 {1:0.00} 枪。这通常由疲劳或急躁造成，目标一被击破就**松开鼠标**。</value></data>
  <data name="Your last 5 runs average {0:0}% below the 5 before. Fatigue or lost focus often causes a dip like this, so take a **short break** or warm up on an easier scenario before continuing." xml:space="preserve"><value>最近 5 局的平均分比之前 5 局低 {0:0}%。疲劳或注意力下降常会造成这种下滑，建议**短暂休息**，或用较简单的场景热身后再继续。</value></data>
  <data name="Your best runs have {0:0}% smoother mouse movement. Your good runs reach each target in **one clean motion**, so try not to stop and correct on the way." xml:space="preserve"><value>你最好的几局鼠标移动平滑度高出 {0:0}%。好成绩的特点是**一气呵成**地到达每个目标，尽量不要中途停下再修正。</value></data>
  <data name="Your best runs change direction {0:0}% less often. Frequent reversals usually mean **overcorrecting**, so try making smaller, calmer adjustments." xml:space="preserve"><value>你最好的几局方向变化少 {0:0}%。频繁折返通常意味着**过度修正**，试着做更小、更平稳的调整。</value></data>
  <data name="Your best runs click {0:0} ms sooner after the mouse stops. Waiting after you arrive costs time, so try **clicking as you land** on the target." xml:space="preserve"><value>你最好的几局在鼠标停下后点击快 {0:0} 毫秒。到达后再等待会浪费时间，试着**一到目标就点击**。</value></data>
  <data name="Your best runs react in {0:0.00}s, your worst in {1:0.00}s. Deciding on the next target **earlier** saves time, so look for it before you finish the current one." xml:space="preserve"><value>你最好的几局反应时间为 {0:0.00} 秒，最差的几局为 {1:0.00} 秒。**更早**确定下一个目标能节省时间，在打完当前目标之前就去找下一个。</value></data>
  <data name="Your average is {0:0}% higher at {1} cm/360 ({2} runs) than at your usual {3} cm/360. This scenario rewards **fine control** more than reach, so try playing it at the lower sensitivity more often." xml:space="preserve"><value>你在 {1} cm/360（{2} 局）下的平均分比平时的 {3} cm/360 高 {0:0}%。这个场景更看重**精细控制**而不是移动幅度，建议多用较低的灵敏度来玩。</value></data>
  <data name="Your average is {0:0}% higher at {1} cm/360 ({2} runs) than at your usual {3} cm/360. This scenario rewards **reaching targets quickly** more than fine control, so try playing it at the higher sensitivity more often." xml:space="preserve"><value>你在 {1} cm/360（{2} 局）下的平均分比平时的 {3} cm/360 高 {0:0}%。这个场景更看重**快速到达目标**而不是精细控制，建议多用较高的灵敏度来玩。</value></data>
  <data name="Your last 5 runs average {0:0}% below the 5 before. A drop this large rarely recovers by playing on, so **stop this scenario for today**; practice while tired mostly trains tired habits." xml:space="preserve"><value>最近 5 局的平均分比之前 5 局低 {0:0}%。降幅这么大，继续玩很难恢复，**今天先别玩这个场景了**；疲劳时练习多半只会练出疲劳的习惯。</value></data>
  <data name="{0} plays since your last personal best. Repeating the same drill has stopped raising it, so spend a while on a **variant** of this scenario (smaller or faster targets, another sensitivity) and then come back." xml:space="preserve"><value>距离上次个人最佳已经玩了 {0} 次。重复同一个练习已经无法再提高成绩，建议先花一段时间练这个场景的**变体**（更小或更快的目标、其他灵敏度），然后再回来。</value></data>
  <data name="Your first run of each sitting scores {0:0}% below the runs after it. The first attempt goes to getting used to the scenario again, so treat it as a **warm-up run** and judge yourself on the ones that follow." xml:space="preserve"><value>每次开始训练时，你的第一局比之后的成绩低 {0:0}%。第一次尝试主要用来重新适应场景，把它当作**热身局**，用之后的成绩来评判自己。</value></data>
  <data name="After {0} runs in a row your scores drop {1:0}%. Long streaks on one scenario stop paying off, so **switch to another scenario** after about {0} runs and come back later." xml:space="preserve"><value>连续玩 {0} 局之后，你的分数会下降 {1:0}%。长时间连续玩同一个场景收益会递减，玩大约 {0} 局后**换一个场景**，稍后再回来。</value></data>
  <data name="Your best runs take a straighter path to each target ({0:P0} direct, against {1:P0} in your worst). Curved or wandering paths waste time, so **aim in a straight line** at the target before you move." xml:space="preserve"><value>你最好的几局走向目标的路径更直（直线度 {0:P0}，最差的几局为 {1:P0}）。弯曲或游移的路径会浪费时间，移动之前先**沿直线**瞄准目标。</value></data>
  <data name="{0} of the {1} scenarios this session got only one run. A single attempt mostly goes to getting used to the scenario, so play **fewer scenarios a few runs each**." xml:space="preserve"><value>本次训练的 {1} 个场景中有 {0} 个只玩了一局。单次尝试大多用于适应场景，建议**少玩几个场景，每个多玩几局**。</value></data>
  <data name="You played {0} {1} times in a row, and the runs after the first {2} scored {3:0}% lower. Returns fade on a long streak, so **move on** to another scenario sooner and come back later." xml:space="preserve"><value>你连续玩了 {1} 次 {0}，前 {2} 局之后的成绩低了 {3:0}%。连续玩得越久收益越低，建议更早**换到别的场景**，稍后再回来。</value></data>
  <data name="Your scores are highest when you hit {0:P0}–{1:P0} of your shots. Your last 10 runs average {2:P0}, so take **a little more care** with each shot." xml:space="preserve"><value>当你的命中率在 {0:P0}–{1:P0} 时分数最高。你最近 10 局平均为 {2:P0}，所以每一枪要**再谨慎一点**。</value></data>
  <data name="Your scores are highest when you hit {0:P0}–{1:P0} of your shots. Your last 10 runs average {2:P0}, so **push the pace** and take shots sooner, even if a few more miss." xml:space="preserve"><value>当你的命中率在 {0:P0}–{1:P0} 时分数最高。你最近 10 局平均为 {2:P0}，所以要**加快节奏**，更早开枪，哪怕多漏几枪也没关系。</value></data>
  <data name="Your best runs fire {0:0.00} shots per kill at targets that are already dead, your worst {1:0.00}. Those extra shots cost time, so **release the click** the moment a target breaks." xml:space="preserve"><value>你最好的几局每次击杀会向已被击杀的目标多开 {0:0.00} 枪，最差的几局为 {1:0.00} 枪。这些多余的射击会浪费时间，目标一被击破就**松开鼠标**。</value></data>
